abstract: >-
  Game Studio Sub-Agents is an AI-powered game development system that provides
  developers with a team of 5 specialized AI agents. Each agent handles specific
  aspects of game development from market analysis to QA testing, supporting
  Godot, Unity, and Unreal Engine with engine-specific optimizations and best
  practices. Available as a Claude Code plugin for easy installation and use.
